class Solution {
    public int maxDistance(int[] colors) {
        int n = colors.length;
        int i = 0;
        int j = n - 1;
        while (colors[i] == colors[n - 1]) {
            i++;
        }
        while (colors[j] == colors[0]) {
            j--;
        }       
        return Math.max(n - 1 - i, j);
    }
}


-----------------------------------------
Do alag colors wale houses ke beech ka maximum distance nikalna (jo hamesha pehle ya aakhri element se hi possible hai).
int n = colors.length; — Array ki length li.

int i = 0; int j = n - 1; — Two pointers set kiye (start aur end).

while (colors[i] == colors[n - 1]) i++; — Left se aage badho jab tak aakhri element se different color na mil jaye.
while (colors[j] == colors[0]) j--; — Right se peeche aao jab tak pehle element se different color na mil jaye.

return Math.max(n - 1 - i, j); — Dono cases mein se jo bada distance ho, wahi answer hai.

Complexity: Time $O(N)$ | Space $O(1)$
